  "summary": {
    "ja": "基準状態から各段階を構成する多段反復で、擬似時間を進めて定常残差を減衰させます。",
    "en": "A multistage iteration forms each stage from a fixed base state and advances pseudo-time to damp steady residuals."
  },
  "status": "educational-example",
  "origin": "development-candidate",
  "reading": {
