  "assumptions": [
    "The selected coefficients are 1/4, 1/3, 1/2 and 1; all stages share the same base state.",
    "Residuals, modal amplitudes and phase are measured on a fixed 16-component periodic linear system."
  ],
  "assumptions_ja": [
    "採用係数は1/4,1/3,1/2,1で、各段階の基準値は同じです。",
    "固定した16成分の周期線形系で残差・モード振幅・位相を測ります。"
  ],
  "units": "The product of pseudo-time step and operator eigenvalue is dimensionless; physical-time accuracy is a separate question.",
  "units_ja": "擬似時間刻みと作用素固有値の積は無次元です。物理時間精度の主張とは分けます。",
  "boundary_conditions": "The fixed example applies periodic differences at every stage.",
  "boundary_conditions_ja": "固定例は周期格子で、周期差分を全段階に適用します。",
  "limitations": {
    "ja": "採用多項式は線形問題では古典RK4と一致しますが、一般非線形問題の4次法ではありません。安定なモード、非減衰対照、発散対照を区別します。",
    "en": "The chosen stability polynomial matches classical RK4 on linear problems, but this is not a fourth-order method for general nonlinear problems. Stable modes, a neutral control and an expanding control are distinguished."
  },
